    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "peace? what peace? there's no peace in a city that's designed to drain you dry. every morning it's just more of the same... working, eating, sleeping, just to do it all again. it feels like i'm just a cog in a machine that doesn't even care if i break. i feel like there's nothing left for me here. like i've already reached the end of my rope and there's nothing on the other side but more smog.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
